Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.26,0:02:35.63,akiba-title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1200,0)\bord0.1\4c&H48484A&\c&HFEFEFE&\shad4\blur3\pos(668.618,139.455)}{\fs-4\fn微軟正黑體}經營特別篇
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.26,0:02:35.63,akiba-sp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1200,0)\bord0.1\shad4\blur3\fs105\pos(386.4,432)\4c&H48484A&\c&HFEFEFE&}地球{\fs75}的{\fs105}覺醒
