Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.94,0:02:14.07,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\fn微軟正黑體\fs58.5\b1\c&H5D5A64&\3c&HF2F1F5&\4c&HF7F7F7&\pos(955.2,1057.8)}蘿莉芭芭拉
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.64,0:16:04.40,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,{\an7}詛咒你
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.63,0:18:35.17,akiba-sp,,0,0,0,,{\fs105\bord3\shad1.5\c&H41E8E1&\4c&H41E8E1&\pos(948,196.8)}倒數
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.63,0:18:35.17,akiba-sp,,0,0,0,,{\fs105\bord1.5\shad3\c&H1300C6&\4c&HFBFBFB&\3c&HC8C8F8&\pos(962.4,921.6)}開始
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.53,0:23:13.53,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs-2}死活，圍棋術語，是研究單方死或活的關於眼的問題
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.53,0:23:13.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(215,1030)}是專家的話就讀一下吧\N死活仙人\N—接近神之手的途徑—
