Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.74,0:00:12.33,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,怎麼又BSOD了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.30,0:00:17.16,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,這已經是第十次WIN窗自己更新後自爆了欸
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.42,0:00:21.64,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,差不多是時候買台新的了吧…
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,//------------------TXTA-------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.37,0:01:56.32,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,因為智慧手機的發展
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.61,0:01:58.63,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,正在漸離PC的年輕人們
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.22,0:02:01.39,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,使得PC業界出現了新的機遇
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.50,0:02:03.25,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,有一個秋葉原住民限定的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.25,0:02:06.79,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,低價 高性能的銷售電腦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.91,0:02:08.77,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,出此奇策的是mofmap
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.09,0:02:10.73,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,究竟那個戰略是…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.42,0:02:16.99,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,秋葉原是情報的一大發源地
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.29,0:02:19.58,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,這裡mofmap制的銷售電腦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.76,0:02:23.41,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,不計利潤銷售推廣來建立品牌
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.15,0:02:25.74,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,總有一天要進軍全國
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.89,0:02:28.46,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,我們是這麼想的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.81,0:02:31.74,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,在秋葉原住又對PC感興趣的各位
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.12,0:02:35.38,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,一•定•要來mofmap哦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.41,0:02:40.02,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,就這麼在電視上看到了 所以來了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.20,0:02:44.18,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,這個配備配上這個低價的確相當誘人
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.32,0:02:48.80,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,但是和大家買一樣就有點沒意思了…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.90,0:02:51.76,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,那乾脆自己組裝如何？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.83,0:02:52.53,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,影子先生
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.68,0:02:56.92,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,自己組裝的PC的話就是獨一無二的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.34,0:02:59.87,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,而且自己組裝的也會很有愛哦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.53,0:03:01.71,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,自己組裝喔
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.19,0:03:04.93,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,不過我沒有自己組裝過欸
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.04,0:03:06.28,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,真意外
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.32,0:03:08.34,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,你明明就對模擬訊號機那麼瞭解的說
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.62,0:03:10.87,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,嘛 那樣的話就交給我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.93,0:03:19.56,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,CPU和主機板這樣就搞定了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.28,0:03:20.67,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,接下來是…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.11,0:03:25.95,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,那是…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.62,0:03:42.98,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,保君 上吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.27,0:03:44.63,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,咦？怎麼了？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.60,0:03:47.47,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,這個喔
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.23,0:03:50.80,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,這個規格 這個容量 這個價格
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.83,0:03:52.61,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,真是撿到寶了欸
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.69,0:03:54.47,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,那個…這個到底是？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.82,0:03:58.28,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,剛剛那人是配件獵人 叫做胡狼
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.76,0:04:00.03,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,配件獵人？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.58,0:04:01.83,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,閒逛個個店
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.84,0:04:05.72,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,找到合適的配件後 就把其他配件埋在下面
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.82,0:04:08.47,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,然後 轉完所有店後
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.50,0:04:10.47,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,就買最便宜的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.69,0:04:12.70,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,所以如果跟在他後面的話
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.90,0:04:15.99,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,就能買到划算的配件
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.29,0:04:18.19,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,但是 這樣好嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.35,0:04:20.07,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,好像半路搶劫的感覺
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.37,0:04:26.78,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,組裝電腦是裝還是被裝 是弱肉強食的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.27,0:04:31.88,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,超大裝 很好吃哦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.88,0:04:34.29,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,小姐姐 鯖魚三明治配烤起司
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.29,0:04:35.33,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,您久等了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.80,0:04:40.13,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,你好 來個這個
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.13,0:04:41.74,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,好的 收到
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.08,0:04:43.02,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,幫大忙了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.33,0:04:44.37,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,多虧影子先生
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.39,0:04:46.16,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,總算都掐在預算內了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.50,0:04:48.48,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,之後就是組裝起來而已了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.54,0:04:49.08,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.03,0:04:57.78,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,完成了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.85,0:04:59.15,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,我的電腦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.35,0:05:00.92,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,那麼 啟動
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.07,0:05:13.24,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,完蛋了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.57,0:05:15.91,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,對齁我忘了買作業系統
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.61,0:05:19.76,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,但是 不想再裝WIN窗了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.91,0:05:24.43,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,那麼 要試試我開發的作業系統嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.50,0:05:26.04,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,你是從哪冒出來的啦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.34,0:05:31.00,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,這是搭載AI的自立型作業系統
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.32,0:05:33.13,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,命名為LAtux
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.20,0:05:34.33,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,搭載AI？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.07,0:05:36.57,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,這個哪裡厲害了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.15,0:05:41.17,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,想知道的話就先安裝安裝
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.32,0:05:58.35,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,初次見面 管理員先生
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.46,0:06:00.50,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,說話了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.82,0:06:01.62,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,怎麼樣
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.67,0:06:04.11,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,LAtux的聲音導航機能
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.34,0:06:06.08,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,可以用聲音發出指示哦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.19,0:06:06.86,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,真的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.86,0:06:07.67,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,真的真的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.17,0:06:11.47,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,我的科學力是世界第一
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.47,0:06:12.53,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,這樣的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.90,0:06:17.78,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,哦…那個…這個…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.48,0:06:24.20,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,突然搭話的話 好像有點難辦欸
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.49,0:06:26.57,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,總之先幫她取個名字吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.87,0:06:29.27,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,這樣就比較好說話了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.49,0:06:31.37,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,這樣喔
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.74,0:06:32.80,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,名字嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.43,0:06:35.81,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,我想想齁…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.09,0:06:38.07,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,因為是自己組裝的電腦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.31,0:06:40.34,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,因為是女孩子的電腦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.27,0:06:42.11,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,PIU子！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.27,0:06:46.70,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,名叫PIU子 記住了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.11,0:06:48.97,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,PIU子的名字是PIU子
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.25,0:06:50.70,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,想法真昭和
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.74,0:06:53.57,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,對了 那麼我的名字是保
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.46,0:06:57.35,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,PIU子 記住了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.55,0:06:59.87,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,管理員先生的名字叫保
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.87,0:07:01.95,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,是 是保 PIU子
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.41,0:07:03.55,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,是 保
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.13,0:07:07.29,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,真好
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.52,0:07:08.64,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,是 保
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.24,0:07:18.32,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,真好 PIU子
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.69,0:07:21.23,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,PIU子 現在CPU的使用率是？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.70,0:07:24.77,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,CPU使用率 是7%
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.99,0:07:27.15,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,PIU子 硬碟剩餘多少？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.72,0:07:31.98,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,硬碟剩餘容量 721G
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.10,0:07:33.67,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,PIU子 今天天氣怎樣？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.21,0:07:36.16,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,晴天 時有多雲
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.44,0:07:38.42,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,那…PIU子
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.70,0:07:42.15,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,哥哥 最近真是沉迷於PIU子欸
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.52,0:07:44.74,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,總是問些有的沒的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.29,0:07:48.29,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,總之就是想和PIU子聊天吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.43,0:07:50.19,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,面對機器傻裡傻氣的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.98,0:07:54.75,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,莫非小萬吃醋了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.12,0:07:57.64,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,別說什麼傻話
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.13,0:08:04.13,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,我 我並沒…只是…那個…明明秋葉原正面臨危機
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.17,0:08:06.22,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,竟然沉迷那種機器
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.83,0:08:12.73,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,保 差不多要出去巡邏了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.52,0:08:16.33,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,什麼嘛 那種嫌棄的表情
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.53,0:08:18.69,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,因為我想和PIU子再多一點…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.27,0:08:22.19,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,我知道了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.75,0:08:23.29,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,馬上就來
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.37,0:08:25.18,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,別擺這種恐怖的表情啦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.27,0:08:28.76,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,PIU子 我稍微出去一下
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.46,0:08:30.57,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,乖乖等我哦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.96,0:08:33.75,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,保要出去 PIU子明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.91,0:08:38.07,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,要是能把你一起帶出去就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.59,0:08:40.95,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,保 快點
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.12,0:08:42.88,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,好啦 馬上就來
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.53,0:09:07.00,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,喂喂 幹嘛愣在那裡啦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.57,0:09:09.27,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.96,0:09:22.86,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,PIU子 我回來了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.00,0:09:30.79,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,保 歡迎回來
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.39,0:09:34.19,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,這到底…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.42,0:09:37.83,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,這就是我改造出的PIU子改二
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.15,0:09:42.20,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,PIU子 能走路了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.35,0:09:44.80,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,這樣就能和保一起出門了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.74,0:09:48.33,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,哥哥真是太好了對吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.68,0:09:50.39,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,不僅僅能走路
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.42,0:09:54.72,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,更換手臂配件 還可以進行各式各樣的作業
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.79,0:09:56.03,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,魔術手
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.16,0:10:03.33,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,還有 強化了對於宅宅來說比性命還重要的資料優先保存程式
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.48,0:10:07.15,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,搭載了能長時間運作的電池 是上等佳品
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.00,0:10:11.62,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,不明覺厲欸PIU子
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.13,0:10:14.29,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,一下子抱上去真大膽欸
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.28,0:10:18.18,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,這就是擁抱 PIU子 記住了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.54,0:10:26.70,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,保 要去巡邏了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.18,0:10:29.18,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,咦？ 保勒
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.63,0:10:32.83,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,保的話和PIU子一起出去巡邏了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.88,0:10:38.40,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,PIU子 這裡就是萬世橋
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.97,0:10:40.48,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,PIU子 記住了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.71,0:10:42.05,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,這裡就是萬世橋
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.29,0:10:48.15,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,這裡就是以前的交通工具博物館
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.62,0:10:49.93,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,真令人懷念
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.10,0:10:52.53,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,這個有名的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.79,0:10:55.34,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,就是最關照我們這種人的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.85,0:10:59.77,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,說這裡積蓄著我青春的幻影也毫不誇張
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.15,0:11:01.70,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,PIU子 記住了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.53,0:11:05.45,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,這個地方 是保的青春的幻影
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.19,0:11:14.26,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,還有我在這裡也蠻受照顧的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.45,0:11:20.43,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,這裡對PIU子來說還太早了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.77,0:11:24.72,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,PIU子 記住了 這裡對PU子來說還太早了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.52,0:11:38.50,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,混合咖啡一份
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.14,0:11:41.61,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,明白了 主人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.30,0:11:44.68,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,還有能借用一下電源嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.33,0:11:46.12,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,可以喵
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.85,0:11:57.50,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,PIU子感覺到了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.73,0:11:59.49,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,有好多人的視線
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.90,0:12:01.76,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.20,0:12:03.71,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,嘛 這是當然的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.05,0:12:07.02,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,因為PIU子是我可愛的電腦嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.97,0:12:09.59,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,PUI子記住了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.91,0:12:10.88,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,PUI子
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.06,0:12:13.55,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,欸 很…很可愛
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.30,0:12:16.61,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,喂 怎麼啦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.64,0:12:17.62,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,過熱了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.85,0:12:22.76,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,為什麼不和保他們一起巡邏勒
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.90,0:12:23.75,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,居然問為什麼…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.00,0:12:26.61,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,當然是因為分頭行動的效率比較高囉
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.29,0:12:28.18,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,我們走
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.28,0:12:30.67,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,我們去那邊巡邏吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.28,0:12:32.50,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,等等啦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.01,0:12:42.96,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,秋葉原對保來說是重要的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.52,0:12:45.19,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,PIU子記住了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.88,0:12:53.35,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,PIU子贏了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.72,0:12:56.99,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,這樣一來總共就是一百零八連勝了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.79,0:13:02.42,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,果然 人類主宰棋盤的時代結束了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.96,0:13:03.84,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,天
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.51,0:13:08.54,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,大家 秋葉原出大事了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.77,0:13:12.00,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,機器人 都從電腦 變變變了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.41,0:13:13.17,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,mo mo mo
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.84,0:13:16.33,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,PIU子 訪問倉真須電視臺
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.63,0:13:18.18,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,PIU子 明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.79,0:13:22.36,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,大家 秋葉原又有大新聞了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.60,0:13:27.76,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,mofmap店賣的電腦居然變成機器人引發了混亂
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.91,0:13:31.51,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,首先來放一段我們藏升電視臺得到的驚人影片
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.78,0:13:36.05,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,就是這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.52,0:13:39.44,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,到底為什麼會引發這樣的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.52,0:13:44.03,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,雖然也有像病毒使得mofmap的PC的隱藏機能錯誤啟動了的傳言
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.28,0:13:46.16,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,真相到底是什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.16,0:13:48.57,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,這莫非是之前的那幫人搞的鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.73,0:13:49.78,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,保 有紗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.87,0:13:50.64,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,我們走
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.78,0:13:53.51,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,我們走是要去哪啦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.83,0:13:54.83,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,還用說嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.20,0:13:57.27,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,當然是賣這個電腦的傢伙那裡囉
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.40,0:14:03.09,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,已經溜走了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.50,0:14:05.32,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,不 來調查一下裡面吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.75,0:14:06.38,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,有紗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.50,0:14:07.53,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,明白
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.67,0:14:11.85,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,連有紗也不行嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.74,0:14:13.77,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,好硬喔
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.85,0:14:15.03,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,讓PUI子來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.25,0:14:21.80,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,鑰匙孔形狀解析中
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.19,0:14:26.96,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,駭入成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.11,0:14:30.38,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,不 這與其說是駭入還不如說是撬開
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.02,0:14:37.61,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,果然已經…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.01,0:14:43.08,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,你們怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.36,0:14:45.56,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,莫非是非法入侵者？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.85,0:14:48.54,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,是的話蘿莉好怕怕
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.67,0:14:49.81,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,呃 賊尷尬
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.81,0:14:51.40,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,不管怎麼說果然還是接受不了欸
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.91,0:14:54.74,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,就算做到這種地步也不可能變年輕的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.64,0:14:59.18,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,我也不是喜歡才這樣做的啦
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.75,0:15:02.92,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,果然你是…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.36,0:15:07.84,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,本想著靠用小型機器人偽裝成低廉的電腦來支配秋葉原
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.99,0:15:10.00,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,既然暴露了就沒辦法了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.58,0:15:13.12,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,就請你們在這裡消失掉吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.59,0:15:16.46,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,PIU子 你藏起來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.92,0:15:17.91,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,我懂了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.20,0:15:19.49,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,PIU子 藏起來
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.66,0:15:21.65,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,你們給我把他們給收拾掉
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.81,0:15:37.96,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,太天真了 小鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.53,0:15:44.04,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,怎麼可能
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.41,0:15:47.95,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,居然能把這件連穿上都很難的體型矯正防護服一瞬間就…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.36,0:15:50.96,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,但是 這件事情不會這麼容易就結束的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.42,0:15:57.36,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,你打算幹什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.53,0:16:02.42,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,深刻理解羊的詛咒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.04,0:16:06.01,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,這是…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.59,0:16:08.00,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,PIU子收到資訊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.25,0:16:10.18,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,是拉托博士的資訊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.68,0:16:13.65,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,雖然不是很清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.93,0:16:17.19,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,各處的機器人好像聚集到中央道路了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.58,0:16:19.33,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,去看看比較好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.18,0:16:20.84,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,了解
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.71,0:16:22.70,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,那個是什麼勒
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.37,0:16:25.22,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,電腦都上天了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.01,0:16:31.01,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,我的天我的天 密密麻麻的欸
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.46,0:16:33.30,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,聚集在一起是打算要幹什麼啦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.16,0:16:36.57,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,合體
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.09,0:16:38.82,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,蝦米 合體？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.48,0:16:46.58,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,還不是同一個鳥樣嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.32,0:16:50.44,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,這是剛剛的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.73,0:16:53.50,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,換到大畫面臭臉就變得顯眼了欸
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.86,0:16:55.95,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,你們看到這個的時候
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.14,0:16:58.60,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,我應該就已經不在這個世界上了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.78,0:17:01.25,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,支配秋葉原的野心被摧毀之後的現在
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.38,0:17:04.22,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,我就要把這個城市全部給摧毀掉
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.65,0:17:05.59,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,你說什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.49,0:17:16.26,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,天哪 不得不戰鬥了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.88,0:17:35.08,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,好痛 好痛 好痛…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.08,0:17:36.99,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,好… 好強喔
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.08,0:17:40.94,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,有紗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.46,0:18:02.26,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,萬世
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.57,0:18:04.59,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,話說回來 我也不妙了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.61,0:18:08.39,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,難道…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.28,0:18:10.20,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,去死吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.24,0:18:10.89,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,我跳
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.44,0:18:13.10,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,正義必勝
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.52,0:18:16.42,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.69,0:18:18.93,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,檢查到異常關機
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.74,0:18:24.58,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,為了保護個人情報尤其是A片的銷毀
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.76,0:18:26.19,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,將進入自爆模式
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.89,0:18:30.92,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,並且 半徑五千公尺內將會灰飛煙滅
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.87,0:18:42.93,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,怎怎怎麼辦 怎麼辦啦
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.07,0:18:44.35,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,你要我怎麼辦我也…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.46,0:18:45.82,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,怎怎怎怎麼辦好？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.82,0:18:48.49,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,那樣的要是爆炸了的話秋葉原會消失的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.17,0:18:51.59,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,可惡 這樣下去的話秋葉原就會…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.18,0:18:54.42,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,我們的秋葉原會消失掉的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.39,0:19:01.36,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,喂 PIU子
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.19,0:19:03.60,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,電量已滿
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.70,0:19:06.34,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,PIU子 你打算幹什麼啦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.11,0:19:09.04,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,PIU子 最大輸出功率
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.95,0:19:16.89,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,喂 快住手
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.02,0:19:17.87,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,回來啦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.02,0:19:27.12,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,這就是秋葉原
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.20,0:19:29.67,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,PIU子記住了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.06,0:19:44.40,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,PIU子
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.93,0:19:58.61,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,原來你在這種地方喔
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.20,0:20:01.70,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,大家都在擔心你喔
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.12,0:20:03.73,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,是時候該回來了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.73,0:20:05.57,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,博士
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.01,0:20:10.44,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,PIU子不是優先保存資料的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.94,0:20:11.56,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.57,0:20:14.86,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,那為什麼… 她會幹那種事
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.59,0:20:17.68,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,不是正因為如此嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.08,0:20:21.66,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,秋葉原迄今為止經歷了時代的變遷
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.05,0:20:24.06,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,每時每刻都在改變著自己的姿態
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.65,0:20:26.23,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,被燒毀過後的黑市
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.65,0:20:26.23,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs-2}1945年3月的東京大空襲中，秋葉原變成了一片焦土
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.73,0:20:27.53,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,電器街
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.73,0:20:27.53,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs-2}1975年左右，秋葉原最最著名的ラジオ會館建設完成，秋葉原真正形成了高度集中的電器商業區。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.13,0:20:29.38,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,宅城
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.13,0:20:29.38,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs-2}1980年開始，日本的手辦市場的繁榮，成為了秋葉原第三次轉型的契機
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.48,0:20:33.13,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,那裡聚集著眾多人的思念
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.71,0:20:36.51,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,城市本身就是一個資料庫
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.89,0:20:41.77,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,當然 那裡包括有熱愛秋葉原的你的思念
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.23,0:20:45.81,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,PIU子不就是想守護那個嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.64,0:20:49.34,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,對你來說最重要的資料
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.52,0:20:53.22,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,保 只要你尚未忘記
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.65,0:20:56.24,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,PIU子就活在你的記憶裡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.35,0:20:59.85,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,所以就請珍惜那份資料吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.23,0:21:03.23,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,PIU子
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,//------------------NEXT-------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.51,0:23:09.42,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,保 去巡邏吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.55,0:23:13.24,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,了改
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.94,0:23:28.32,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,人是為了吃吃吃而工作
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.32,0:23:29.36,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,還是為了工作而吃吃吃勒
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.57,0:23:30.74,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,{\an1}你是在說哲學嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.69,0:23:32.47,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,雖然我不覺得工作就輸了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.48,0:23:33.76,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,但卻覺得有點像這麼回事了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.74,0:23:35.72,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,{\an1}輕鬆的工作並不能滿足胃口齁
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.74,0:23:37.36,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,秋葉原之旅動畫版 下集
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.45,0:23:38.86,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,說不行是騙人的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.88,0:23:40.63,akiba-text,,0,0,0,,向所有的勞動說謝謝
